Package: MMLCA
Type: Package
Title: Latent Class Analysis to Identify Multimorbidity Patterns
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Caterina Gregorio
Maintainer: The package maintainer <caterina.gregorio@ki.se>
Description: MMLCA aims to simplify the identification of multimorbidity patterns through user-friendly functions. Leveraging the power of Latent Class Analysis (LCA) as implemented in the poLCA package, MMLCA provides an accessible and efficient tool for researchers.
